          "title": "Trusted Access Policy Review: \"GA7-demo2 (Staging / Dev)\"",
          "severity": "MEDIUM",
          "application": "GA7-demo2 (Staging / Dev)",
          "vendor": "Internal Domain Tool",
          "affectedAccount": "Domain OU: /",
          "clientId": "696916210722-n0mvdqjq01ebg21eeaeraggm9vb0jbr6.apps.googleusercontent.com",
          "details": "\"GA7-demo2 (Staging / Dev)\" is marked as \"Trusted\" in Google Admin Console (allowing access to all Google data), but only 1 active user is currently utilizing it. Setting broad \"Trusted\" status increases potential blast radius if client credentials are compromised.",
