          "rule": "TRUSTED_POLICY_LEAST_PRIVILEGE",
          "title": "Trusted Access Policy Review: \"OrbitNote (Web Application)\"",
          "severity": "MEDIUM",
          "application": "OrbitNote (Web Application)",
          "vendor": "Texthelp Ltd.",
          "affectedAccount": "Domain OU: /",
          "clientId": "243341882805-ifm1nlmmaiphpqltrhc3am7tf31cttc2.apps.googleusercontent.com",
          "details": "\"OrbitNote (Web Application)\" is marked as \"Trusted\" in Google Admin Console (allowing access to all Google data), but only 0 active user is currently utilizing it. Setting broad \"Trusted\" status increases potential blast radius if client credentials are compromised.",
          "remediation": "Review this app in Google Admin Console (Security > API Controls > App Access Control). Consider scoping access down from \"Trusted\" to \"Specific Google data\" or restricting the policy to specific organizational units.",
